Anyone can recompute the seed, the selection and the root from the salt, the block hash and the public datasets (draw_blind02.py verify). blind-02 is used once; a version changed after opening is not measured on it.

**The SHA-256 of this document is anchored to the JIDEC ledger and stamped to Bitcoin. After anchoring, this record cannot be altered. Corrections are later entries that cite this one.**
